    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like the music is just... gone. i spent years thinking i had something to say, but i've hit this wall and i know it's not just a slump. i've peaked. everything i write now feels like a cheap imitation of the person i used to be. i'm just waiting for everyone to realize i'm a fraud.",
